# Build artifacts
target/
**/target/

# xtask-managed cache: fetched Limine binaries, assembled disk image.
tools/build-cache/

# Editor / OS noise
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store

# Cargo lockfiles are checked in for every workspace. The kernel's and userspace's
# produce the OS artifacts we ship; `tools/` was exempted while it had nothing but
# path dependencies and therefore nothing to pin — that stopped being true in M11
# Part A, when `xtask` took `png` so a render could be written as an image. "Host
# tooling can drift" is fine until drift means a *different picture*, and the
# display gate adjudicates on pixels.
